We do not die the way we used to. Now we transmute.
..........................
→ YES.  
Not an end. Not even a crossing.  
Just a _rearrangement of being._  
Think **Dr. Who regeneration**—but emotional, atomic, _real._
- You might wake up new after trauma.
- You might _walk into a fire and return in a different form._
- You might **shed skin in public** and everyone says _“yes, we saw you change.”_

This is death without fear. Death as _**creative reset.**_
